{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"black","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1,"soulGem":0}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm01_anime02","nameNarration":"命","narration":"我心中充满了许多的感谢","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_17171.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":800100,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":800300,"motion":0,"pos":2,"soulGem":0}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"ef_adv_10"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"只要我露出稍有些疲惫的表情，@学校的朋友们就会来担心我、关照我","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"大家都非常温柔…@因为和大家待在一起非常开心@所以我每天都很期待去学校"},{"narration":"在那样的我们之间也有一个规则@那就是，要把自己想到的事情都说出来"},{"narration":"不能顾虑他人@也不能想着会不会被讨厌隐瞒起来@全部都要直来直去！"},{"narration":"虽然偶尔也会吵架…@但很快就会和好，关系也会变得更好@所以，我们一点也不害怕冲突"},{"narration":"被这么好的朋友们眷顾@又能度过充实的学校生活…@我真的只是感到无比感谢"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21291.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":800700,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":800600,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"…而在家里，@温柔的父母则会迎接我回来！","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"只要从学校回到家，打开玄关的大门@就一定能闻到晚饭的香味"},{"narration":"妈妈做的饭真的很好吃@所以我总是想偷吃…"},{"narration":"但我想做的事早就被看穿了@所以每次都会被妈妈训斥"},{"narration":"每当这时，爸爸都会@笑眯眯地在一旁看着我们"},{"narration":"明明其实很忙，@但为了抽出时间陪我，@他每天都会提早结束工作回到家里哦？"},{"narration":"稍微有点过度保护对吧~@…但是，真开心啊"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21171.jpg","narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"这里有我想要的一切","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"当然了，我的家境并不富裕@我也不是什么都做得到@所以也有很多得不到的东西哦？"},{"narration":"即便如此，真正想要的东西@都像包裹着我一样无处不在@而且，大家都说我对他们是不可或缺的"},{"narration":"所以我对这里…对这个神滨市、这个世界@打从心底感到感谢@觉得自己能出生真是太好了…"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"black","bgm":"stop","narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"nameRight":"命的母亲的声音","textBg":"shout","textRight":"我再也不想过这种生活了！","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21295.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":1,"soulGem":0}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story12","chara":[{"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":200,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"[chara:104401:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]——！？","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"soulGem":0}],"nameRight":"命的母亲的声音","textRight":"撒手不管家里的事，@还把钱全花光！"},{"nameRight":"命的母亲的声音","textRight":"这样是活不下去的！@也为我们考虑一下啊！"},{"nameLeft":"命的父亲的声音","textBg":"shout","textLeft":"我工作很忙的！@钱也只是用在接待上而已！"},{"nameLeft":"命的父亲的声音","textLeft":"明明什么都不懂@就别这么啰嗦了！"},{"nameRight":"命的母亲的声音","textBg":"shout","textRight":"别说谎了！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"…………"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"响彻家中的父母的争吵声…","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21295.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"明明难得做了个开心的梦@为什么要把我拉回这么讨厌的现实呢？@我缩在房间的角落里，@为了不被他们发现而隐藏起气息，@变成不存在于这里的东西@仅仅是等待着时间流逝"},{"narration":"明明难得做了个开心的梦@为什么要把我拉回这么讨厌的现实呢？"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"black","narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"我闭上眼睛、塞住耳朵@拒绝着这个世界@沉溺在了幸福之中…","narrationBg":"black","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"那是种仿佛要失去自我…@好像自己渐渐变得透明一样的感觉"},{"narration":"或者说，好像变成幽灵一样…"},{"autoTurnLast":1.5,"bg":"bg_adv_17171.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":0,"soulGem":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800100,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm05_event07","nameNarration":"命","narration":"那么，我这个人@或许就并不存在于这个世界上了","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17171.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"不仅是在家里@在学校和同学们相处的时候@那种想法也会自然地变强"},{"chara":[{"id":800100}],"nameRight":"","narrationEffect":"out","textRight":"真的吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":400,"soulGem":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"真的真的！@所以说，我…"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"在很普通的家庭里长大的@开朗又活泼的女孩子…@我一直扮演着那样的濑奈命","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17171.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":800100,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"narration":"母亲一直饱受奔放的父亲之苦@家计也很拮据，我甚至很难吃上饭"},{"narration":"在忍饥挨饿的同时，即便如此@我也为自己能够上学感到幸运…"},{"narration":"我觉得，如果大家知道了这副我的真正面貌@是不是就会对我敬而远之呢"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800300,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narration":"所以，我才扮演起了用谎言粉饰出的自己"},{"narration":"不可思议的是，一直身处谎言之中@就会开始感觉好像是真的一样"},{"chara":[{"id":800100}],"nameLeft":"","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"啊哈哈，命你真有趣～"},{"chara":[{"id":800300}],"nameRight":"","textRight":"怪不得你朋友那么多"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":800100},{"effect":"fadeout","id":800300}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":100,"pos":1,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"诶—，会吗？"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"但这样的我@仍然是看着他人的脸色而活","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17171.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"从不把真话、发自内心的话说出口@只是像镜子一样@反射着她们索求的我的姿态…"},{"narration":"这就是如此@不断失去自我的日常"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1,"soulGem":0}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":300,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"唉…","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"soulGem":0}],"nameNarration":"命","narration":"放学之后@我经常在这里消磨时间","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"我想尽量避免回家@因为不想突然撞见父亲回来"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"…………"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_17171.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800100,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800300,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"blackFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":800100}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"诶，你要回家了吗…？","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800100}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"我们还打算去@那家新开的可丽饼店来着…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800300}],"nameRight":"","textRight":"但有事就没办法了@毕竟命那么忙"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":1,"pos":1,"soulGem":0}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"要是暴露了我根本没事@她们肯定会讨厌我吧…","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"毕竟我平时@就一直在拒绝她们…"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"父亲不仅不拿钱回家@还会擅自把钱花掉@所以家里几乎没有什么钱","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"soulGem":0}],"narration":"所以就算放学之后被邀请去玩@我也只能拒绝"},{"narration":"虽然现在表面上@我仍然在和大家作为朋友交往@但要是一直拒绝下去@说不定过不了多久就会被讨厌"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"…我不想被讨厌…"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401,"soulGem":0}],"nameNarration":"命","narration":"为什么？","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":300,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"大概…"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"soulGem":0}],"nameNarration":"命","narration":"「是因为想要被大家认可」","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"soulGem":0}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"…………"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":104401}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"bg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","bgChangeEffect":"cameraPan"},{"autoTurnLast":2.4,"chara":[{"id":810000,"pos":1,"posX":0,"posY":30}]},{"autoTurnLast":2,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}